  "created": "2021-06-22T00:24:07.558Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be awesome for world creators to be able to create worlds with \"Smaller\" areas to access. With so many avatars that are shorter than 4 feet tall, it would be nice to have the ability as a world creator to make \"Cubby\" style rooms where it's closer to their size, without having the limitation of the player hitbox.",
